      "problem": "Abbie and Kate are making cupcakes. Abbie makes $5$ cupcakes for every $7$ that Kate makes. Which tape diagram represents the given scenario?",
      "worked_solution": "We are told that:\n\nAbbie makes $\\color{blue}5$ cupcakes for every $\\color{red}7$ that Kate makes.\n\nSo, in a tape diagram, Abbie's tape must contain $\\color{blue}5$ boxes, while Kate's tape should have $\\color{red}7$ boxes.\n\nTherefore, the diagram is the following:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14187307/assets/47c6e186cd17bffc7e83cca0c228bc1d05287cfba1bdb394c0a5dd71d411294a.png)",
